OL,3,GNEWSAGirl's 30-shirt challenge during
OL,4,Abrain tumour treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old girl undergoing
OL,7,Fradiotherapy for a recurring brain
OL,8,Ftumour has set herself the challenge of
OL,9,Fwearing a different football shirt on
OL,10,Fevery day of her treatment.
OL,12,FLola, from Salford, is aiming to wear
OL,13,F30 shirts in 30 days during her time at
OL,14,FThe Christie hospital.
OL,16,FShe plans to auction the shirts,
OL,17,Fdonated by clubs and footballers, to
OL,18,Fraise money for The Christie Charity
OL,19,Fand Royal Manchester Children's
OL,20,FHospital.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
