OL,3,GNEWSAGirl's 30-shirt challenge during
OL,4,Abrain tumour treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe challenge follows a similar
OL,7,Ffundraiser she completed aged four,
OL,8,Fwhen she wore a different princess
OL,9,Foutfit to each of her 36 proton beam
OL,10,Ftherapy sessions.
